From 235f03e8a1c56ca08190a406b479c0697e2af420 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@assistant.local>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:05:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add 3D cube rendering with FPS camera (WASD + mouse look)

- Camera: view/projection matrices via PyGLM, yaw/pitch look, WASD+space/shift movement
- InputHandler: tracks held keys and per-frame mouse delta
- Cube mesh: 24 verts (per-face color) + EBO index buffer, replaces TestTriangle
- Shaders: now take m_proj/m_view/m_model uniforms and per-vertex color
- Window: added on_keydown/on_keyup hooks, flush initial mouse delta on grab
- requirements.txt: added PyGLM for matrix math
